  Mode   : KEYBOARD

  Sensor controls:
    Tilt wrist LEFT / RIGHT  →  move / navigate
    Tilt wrist FORWARD/BACK  →  up / down (Snake)
    Flick wrist UP           →  launch ball / select game
    Rotate wrist CW/CCW      →  ball spin / curve (Bricks)

  Keyboard shortcuts (always available):
    ← / →          move paddle / navigate cards
    ↑ / ↓          Snake direction
    SPACE          launch ball
    L              learn mode (gesture training)
    T              test mode (model-assisted control)
    V              validation panel (in test mode)
    G              guided/manual toggle (in learn mode)
    ESC            pause / back to menu
    R              restart (after game over)
    D              toggle debug HUD
    F              toggle fullscreen

